# The local planner: Qwen3-VL 4B (instruct) with a bigger context window.
#
# Ollama's default context is 4096 tokens, and over the OpenAI-compatible API
# (the only API the server speaks) it cannot be raised per request. A real
# page's request is 3,000 to 12,000 tokens, so Ollama silently cut it from the
# front: the system prompt went first and the model answered a different
# question. Measured: a 14,000-token request kept 2,050 tokens and ignored its
# system message; the same request through this file arrived whole and obeyed.
#
# Make it once:  pnpm ollama:setup   (needs `ollama pull qwen3-vl:4b-instruct` first)
FROM qwen3-vl:4b-instruct
PARAMETER num_ctx 16384
